    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Owen Reilly is proud to present No. 17 Ely Place — a superb four-bedroom Georgian residence on one of Dublin’s most distinguished and sought-after addresses.\r\n\r\nMeticulously renovated to an exceptional standard, this elegant home seamlessly blends classic period architecture with contemporary design and state-of-the-art finishes, resulting in a truly luxurious city residence.\r\n\r\nArranged over five levels, the property offers a superb balance of reception and bedroom accommodation, defined by generous proportions, impressive ceiling heights, and excellent natural light throughout. A private west-facing rear patio further enhances the living experience, providing a tranquil outdoor retreat in the heart of the city.\r\n\r\nAt patio level, a beautifully appointed kitchen and dining space is fitted to the highest specification, complemented by a bathroom and excellent storage. The ground floor features a stylish reception room with direct access to the rear laneway, along with a separate study — ideal for modern working.\r\n\r\nThe upper floors host an additional elegant living space and four spacious double bedrooms, each finished with bespoke joinery and ample storage. The principal bedroom benefits from a luxurious en-suite, while two further en-suites and a beautifully finished main bathroom serve the remaining accommodation.\r\n\r\nMore about the location...\r\nEly Place is one of Dublin’s most prestigious Georgian streets, positioned just moments from St. Stephen’s Green and Merrion Square, placing the very best of the city’s business, cultural, and social amenities within easy reach.\r\n\r\nA rare opportunity to rent a refined Georgian home of exceptional quality in a truly unrivalled Dublin 2 setting."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Exceptional four-bedroom Georgian residence.\r\nFully refurbished to an outstanding.\r\nPrime location next to St. Stephen’s Green.\r\nFour spacious double bedrooms.\r\nFour luxurious bathrooms including multiple en-suites.\r\nContemporary fully fitted kitchen with dining area at patio level.\r\nMultiple reception rooms including two separate living rooms and study.\r\nWest-facing rear patio area.\r\nHigh ceilings and elegant period features throughout.\r\nUnderfloor heating at basement level with zoned heating from ground to third floor.\r\nNew high-performance windows and doors throughout.\r\nFully insulated for enhanced energy efficiency.\r\nCat 6 data cabling with WiFi repeaters throughout the property.\r\nFibre broadband ready.\r\nHikvision CCTV and security system with app connectivity.\r\nOutdoor storage to the front."
      },
      {
